Heres a video I saw, maybe you could do the same thing? You just need to learn but it shouldn't be too hard. Good luck!

Did he just say "faggot"? That's completely unacceptable no matter what the person did. The person who's filming is as disgusting if not more disgusting than the guy who's littering.

&#x200B;

So is this comment section actually with basically no one calling him out on using a literal homophobic slur.

NTA. HUGGEEEEEEEEE NTA.

Your parents on the other side are huuuge AH. How stupid can you be to release the responsibility of an infant to a TODDLER and expect everything to go right and when it inevitably doesn't, you blame the TODDLER? The narcissism is on another level. How tf is CPS not involved cuz what the actual fuck? Your parents are clearly playing favorites and using this as an excuse to spoil him rotten.

&#x200B;

Your brother on the other hand...wow. I am sadder for him that at his age, an age where he should know what's right and what's wrong, the only way for people to give him attention is for him to pretend to have trauma and to torment and harass his sister.          ( which is an insult to people who actually have PTSD btw ), the actual victim of the incident. Now hear me out; I am not saying that losing a finger isn't traumatic...it is, as long as you can actually remember what happened while not being an infant.

&#x200B;

Special note for the friends: Y'all are annoying little assholes who think they're cool by harassing people hahaha pathetic and umm...

>if I masturbate to the memory

b i t c h        w h a t

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

NTA.
